* Sat Oct 17 2026 Sebastian Wolf <sebastian@ygriega.de> 0.3-1
- Records runs, walks, bike rides, rowing and drives with GPS: duration,
  distance, current and average pace and speed, elevation and climb, with the
  position and the route on an OpenStreetMap map. Pause with a tap, stop by holding the button. Each
  activity is stored as a GPX file and listed on the main page, newest first,
  where it can be replayed with a slider. The steps move to the lower third of
  the main page.
- Asks for the Location and Internet permissions; no longer for Sensors, which
  Location includes.

* Wed Oct 14 2026 Sebastian Wolf <sebastian@ygriega.de> 0.2-1
- Keeps the steps of each day in a local SQLite database, so the count survives
  closing the app. The main page and the cover show today's steps, the main
  page also those of the three days before. Rhythm-aware step detection: fewer
  double counts and misses, and slow walks are counted.

* Tue Oct 13 2026 Sebastian Wolf <sebastian@ygriega.de> 0.1-1
- First version: counts steps with the accelerometer from the moment the app
  starts, also while the display is off, and shows the count on the main page
  and on the cover. Nothing is stored yet; closing the app ends the count.
